<title>SINGAPORE: Pidemco Land issues Singapore $100 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>Pidemco Land issues Singapore $100 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pidemco Land Ltd, a member of the Singapore Technologies group, said in a statement it has launched a S$100 million floating rate note.</p>
<p>Pidemco said that DBS Bank is the sole manager and agent for the deal which will be for a maximum of five years. The statement did not give terms for the issue, except to say it will pay a margin over the Singapore Interbank Offered Rate.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65) 870-3080</p>
</text>
